{"unit_id":4,"stage_id":4,"lesson":{"lesson_id":13,"lesson_key":"S4L13","stage_id":4,"title":"Zameer-e-Munfasil Mutakallim: يُوسُفُ ← أَنَا يُوسُفُ","title_i18n":{"hinglish":"Zameer-e-Munfasil Mutakallim: يُوسُفُ ← أَنَا يُوسُفُ","en":"1st Person Singular Detached Pronoun (I): يُوسُفُ ← أَنَا يُوسُفُ","ur":"ضمیرِ منفصل متکلم: يُوسُفُ ← أَنَا يُوسُفُ","hi":"ज़मीर-ए-मुन्फ़सिल मुतकल्लिम: يُوسُفُ ← أَنَا يُوسُفُ"},"arabic_Focus":"يُوسُفُ ← أَنَا يُوسُفُ","hinglish_Focus":"Yusuf → Main Yusuf hoon","page_numbers":"30","book_page":30,"sections":[{"id":"sec_hero","type":"hero_header","data":{"arabic":"يُوسُفُ ← أَنَا يُوسُفُ","hinglish":"Yusuf → Main Yusuf hoon","arabic_word":"يُوسُفُ","arabic_combined":"يُوسُفُ ← أَنَا يُوسُفُ","hinglish_word":"Yusuf","hinglish_combined":"Yusuf → Main Yusuf hoon","title_en":"Zameer-e-Munfasil Mutakallim: يُوسُفُ ← أَنَا يُوسُفُ","subtitle":"Unit 4 • Lesson 13 (Book Page 30)","transformations":[{"before_ar":"يُوسُفُ","after_ar":"أَنَا يُوسُفُ","before_hi":"Yusuf","after_hi":"Main Yusuf hoon"}]}},{"id":"sec_intro_table","type":"intro_table","data":{"title":"S4L13 — Zameer-e-Munfasil Mutakallim: يُوسُفُ ← أَنَا يُوسُفُ: Buniyadi Misaalein","caption":"S4L13 — Zameer-e-Munfasil Mutakallim: يُوسُفُ ← أَنَا يُوسُفُ: Buniyadi Misaalein","headers":["Qism / Halat","Arabi Misaal","Hinglish Mafhoom"],"rows":[["أَنَا + Ism","أَنَا يُوسُفُ / أَنَا نَذِيرٌ مُبِينٌ","Main Yusuf hoon / Main khula darane wala hoon"],["وَمَا أَنَا بِـ...","وَمَا أَنَا بِطَارِدِ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ / بِوَكِيلٍ","Aur main mominon ko nikalne wala / zimmedar nahin hoon"],["إِنَّنِي أَنَا / وَأَنَا + الْـ","إِنَّنِي أَنَا اللَّهُ / وَأَنَا التَّوَّابُ الرَّحِيمُ","Beshak Main hi Allah hoon / Aur Main hi tauba qabool karne wala hoon"]]}},{"id":"sec_s4l13_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u4grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u4grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 4 • LESSON 13</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Zameer-e-Munfasil Mutakallim: يُوسُفُ ← أَنَا يُوسُفُ (Page 30)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">يُوسُفُ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Zameer (أَنَا)</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">أَنَا يُوسُفُ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• يُوسُفُ (Yusuf) se أَنَا يُوسُفُ (Main Yusuf hoon) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Qur'an Majeed mein yeh tarkeeb saikdon maqamaat par barah-e-raast samajh aati hai.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Page 30):** Baat karne wala apni zaat ke liye **`أَنَا`** ('Main') istemal karta hai: `أَنَا يُوسُفُ وَهَٰذَا أَخِي` (Main Yusuf hoon aur yeh mera bhai hai), `إِنْ أَنَا إِلَّا نَذِيرٌ مُبِينٌ` (Main toh sirf khula darane wala hoon). `أَنَا` ke aakhir ka Alif likha jata hai magar milakar padhte waqt lamba nahin kiya jata."}},{"id":"sec_s4l13_lbl1","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Darj zail Quranic fiqron ka tarjuma khud kijiye:"}},{"id":"sec_s4l13_r2","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"'أَنَا' (ana) zameer-e-munfasil wahid mutakallim (main) ke liye aati hai. Jab kisi ism se pehle 'أَنَا' lagaya jaye toh mukammal jumla banta hai, jaise: أَنَا يُوسُفُ (Main Yusuf hoon), أَنَا نَذِيرٌ (Main darane / khabardar karne wala hoon)."}},{"id":"sec_s4l13_s3","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s4l13_s3_s1","arabic":"يُوسُفُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">يُوسُفُ</span>","hinglish":"Yusuf","translations":{"en":"Joseph","ur":"یوسف","hi":"यूसुफ़"},"displayOrder":1},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s2","arabic":"أَنَا يُوسُفُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يُوسُفُ</span>","hinglish":"Main Yusuf hoon","translations":{"en":"I am Joseph","ur":"میں یوسف ہوں","hi":"मैं यूसुफ़ हूँ"},"displayOrder":2},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s3","arabic":"نَذِيرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">نَذِيرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Darane wala","translations":{"en":"A warner","ur":"ڈرانے والا","hi":"डराने वाला"},"displayOrder":3},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s4","arabic":"أَنَا نَذِيرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَذِيرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Main darane wala hoon","translations":{"en":"I am a warner","ur":"میں ڈرانے والا ہوں","hi":"मैं डराने वाला हूँ"},"displayOrder":4},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s5","arabic":"بَشَرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بَشَرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Insan","translations":{"en":"A human being","ur":"انسان","hi":"इंसान"},"displayOrder":5},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s6","arabic":"أَنَا بَشَرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَشَرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Main insan hoon","translations":{"en":"I am a human being","ur":"میں انسان ہوں","hi":"मैं इंसान हूँ"},"displayOrder":6}],"cols":2}},{"type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"cols":3,"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s4l13_s3_s7","arabic":"أَنَا اللَّهُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهُ</span>","hinglish":"Main Allah hoon","translations":{"en":"I am Allah","ur":"میں اللہ ہوں","hi":"मैं अल्लाह हूँ"},"displayOrder":1},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s11","arabic":"أَنَا رَسُولٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَسُولٌ</span>","hinglish":"Main Rasool hoon","translations":{"en":"I am a messenger","ur":"میں رسول ہوں","hi":"मैं रसूल हूँ"},"displayOrder":2},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s15","arabic":"أَنَا يُوسُفُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">يُوسُفُ</span>","hinglish":"Main Yusuf hoon","translations":{"en":"I am Joseph","ur":"میں یوسف ہوں","hi":"मैं यूसुफ़ हूँ"},"displayOrder":3},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s8","arabic":"أَنَا بَشَرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَشَرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Main insan hoon","translations":{"en":"I am a human being","ur":"میں انسان ہوں","hi":"मैं इंसान हूँ"},"displayOrder":4},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s12","arabic":"أَنَا خَيْرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خَيْرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Main behtar hoon","translations":{"en":"I am better","ur":"میں بہتر ہوں","hi":"मैं बेहतर हूँ"},"displayOrder":5},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s16","arabic":"أَنَا عَابِدٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَابِدٌ</span>","hinglish":"Main ibadat karne wala hoon","translations":{"en":"I am a worshipper","ur":"میں عبادت کرنے والا ہوں","hi":"मैं इबादत करने वाला हूँ"},"displayOrder":6},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s9","arabic":"أَنَا نَذِيرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَذِيرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Main darane wala hoon","translations":{"en":"I am a warner","ur":"میں ڈرانے والا ہوں","hi":"मैं डराने वाला हूँ"},"displayOrder":7},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s13","arabic":"أَنَا مُنْذِرٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُنْذِرٌ</span>","hinglish":"Main darane wala hoon","translations":{"en":"I am a warner","ur":"میں ڈرانے والا ہوں","hi":"मैं डराने वाला हूँ"},"displayOrder":8},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s17","arabic":"أَنَا بَرِيءٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَرِيءٌ</span>","hinglish":"Main be-taalluq be-qusoor hoon","translations":{"en":"I am innocent / disassociated","ur":"میں بے تعلق بے قصور ہوں","hi":"मैं बे-ताल्लुक़ बे-क़सूर हूँ"},"displayOrder":9},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s10","arabic":"أَنَا نَاصِحٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَاصِحٌ</span>","hinglish":"Main naseehat karne wala hoon","translations":{"en":"I am a sincere adviser","ur":"میں نصیحت کرنے والا ہوں","hi":"मैं नसीहत करने वाला हूँ"},"displayOrder":10},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s14","arabic":"أَنَا عَجُوزٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَجُوزٌ</span>","hinglish":"Main budhiya hoon","translations":{"en":"I am an old woman","ur":"میں بڑھیا ہوں","hi":"मैं बुढ़िया हूँ"},"displayOrder":11},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s18","arabic":"أَنَا أَعْلَمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">أَعْلَمُ</span>","hinglish":"Main zyada ba-ilm hoon","translations":{"en":"I am more knowing","ur":"میں زیادہ با علم ہوں","hi":"मैं ज़्यादा बा-इल्म हूँ"},"displayOrder":12}]}},{"type":"section_label","data":{"text":"Ab darj zail Qur'ani jumlon ka tarjuma kijiye (1–10):","title":"Qur'ani Jumle (1–10)"}},{"type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"cols":2,"is_numbered":true,"items":[{"id":"s4l13_s3_s19","sentence_number":1,"arabic":"أَنَا خَيْرٌ / مِنْ هَذَا","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خَيْرٌ / مِنْ هَذَا</span>","hinglish":"Main behtar hoon iss se","translations":{"en":"I am better / than this","ur":"میں بہتر ہوں / اس سے","hi":"मैं बेहतर हूँ / इस से"},"displayOrder":1,"ref":"43:52"},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s20","sentence_number":2,"arabic":"أَنَا اللَّهُ الْعَزِيزُ الْحَكِيمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللَّهُ الْعَزِيزُ الْحَكِيمُ</span>","hinglish":"Main Allah ghalib hikmat wala hoon","translations":{"en":"I am Allah, the Exalted in Might, the Wise","ur":"میں اللہ غالب حکمت والا ہوں","hi":"मैं अल्लाह ग़ालिब हिकमत वाला हूँ"},"displayOrder":2,"ref":"27:9"},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s21","sentence_number":3,"arabic":"أَنَا خَيْرٌ / مِنْهُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خَيْرٌ / مِنْهُ</span>","hinglish":"Main behtar hoon us se","translations":{"en":"I am better / than him","ur":"میں بہتر ہوں / اس سے","hi":"मैं बेहतर हूँ / उस से"},"displayOrder":3},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s22","sentence_number":4,"arabic":"إِنَّمَا أَنَا رَسُولُ رَبِّكِ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّمَا </span><span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">رَسُولُ رَبِّكِ</span>","hinglish":"Sirf main aapke Rabb ka Rasool hoon","translations":{"en":"I am only the messenger of your Lord","ur":"صرف میں آپ کے رب کا رسول ہوں","hi":"सिर्फ़ मैं आपके रब का रसूल हूँ"},"displayOrder":4,"ref":"19:19"},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s23","sentence_number":5,"arabic":"إِنَّمَا الْآيَاتُ عِنْدَ اللَّهِ / وَإِنَّمَا أَنَا نَذِيرٌ مُبِينٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّمَا الْآيَاتُ عِنْدَ اللَّهِ / وَإِنَّمَا </span><span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَذِيرٌ مُبِينٌ</span>","hinglish":"Sirf nishaniyan Allah ke paas hain aur sirf main khula darane wala hoon","translations":{"en":"The signs are only with Allah, / and I am only a clear warner","ur":"صرف نشانیاں اللہ کے پاس ہیں / اور صرف میں کھلا ڈرانے والا ہوں","hi":"सिर्फ़ निशानियाँ अल्लाह के पास हैं / और सिर्फ़ मैं खुला डराने वाला हूँ"},"displayOrder":5,"full_width":true,"ref":"29:50"},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s24","sentence_number":6,"arabic":"إِنَّمَا الْعِلْمُ عِنْدَ اللَّهِ / وَإِنَّمَا أَنَا نَذِيرٌ مُبِينٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">إِنَّمَا الْعِلْمُ عِنْدَ اللَّهِ / وَإِنَّمَا </span><span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">نَذِيرٌ مُبِينٌ</span>","hinglish":"Sirf ilm Allah ke paas hai aur sirf main khula darane wala hoon","translations":{"en":"The knowledge is only with Allah, / and I am only a clear warner","ur":"صرف علم اللہ کے پاس ہے / اور صرف میں کھلا ڈرانے والا ہوں","hi":"सिर्फ़ इल्म अल्लाह के पास है / और सिर्फ़ मैं खुला डराने वाला हूँ"},"displayOrder":6,"full_width":true,"ref":"67:26"},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s25","sentence_number":7,"arabic":"أَنَا خَيْرٌ / مِنْ هَذَا الَّذِي / هُوَ مَهِينٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">خَيْرٌ / مِنْ هَذَا الَّذِي / هُوَ مَهِينٌ</span>","hinglish":"Main behtar hoon iss se jo ke woh kamtar hai","translations":{"en":"I am better / than this one who / is lowly","ur":"میں بہتر ہوں / اس سے جو کہ / وہ کمتر ہے","hi":"मैं बेहतर हूँ / इस से जो कि / वह कमतर है"},"displayOrder":7,"full_width":true,"ref":"43:52"},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s26","sentence_number":8,"arabic":"وَأَنَا التَّوَّابُ الرَّحِيمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">ال</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">تَّوَّابُ الرَّحِيمُ</span>","hinglish":"Aur main hi tauba qabool karne wala meharban hoon","translations":{"en":"And I am the Accepting of repentance, the Merciful","ur":"اور میں ہی توبہ قبول کرنے والا مہربان ہوں","hi":"और मैं ही तौबा क़बूल करने वाला मेहरबान हूँ"},"displayOrder":8,"ref":"2:160"},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s27","sentence_number":9,"arabic":"أَنَا النَّذِيرُ الْمُبِينُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">ال</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">نَّذِيرُ الْمُبِينُ</span>","hinglish":"Main hi khula darane wala hoon","translations":{"en":"I am the clear warner","ur":"میں ہی کھلا ڈرانے والا ہوں","hi":"मैं ही खुला डराने वाला हूँ"},"displayOrder":9,"ref":"15:89"},{"id":"s4l13_s3_s28","sentence_number":10,"arabic":"أَنَا الْغَفُورُ الرَّحِيمُ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">الْ</span><span class=\"arabic-root\">غَفُورُ الرَّحِيمُ</span>","hinglish":"Main hi bakhshne wala meharban hoon","translations":{"en":"I am the Forgiving, the Merciful","ur":"میں ہی بخشنے والا مہربان ہوں","hi":"मैं ही बख़्शने वाला मेहरबान हूँ"},"displayOrder":10,"ref":"15:49"}]}}]}}